From dbd0640948a4a49e4c7a983d183082ba3b470c1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yolossn <sannagaraj@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 14:04:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] frontend: ClusterContextMenu: Keep built-in Delete
 action
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Treat plugin cluster actions as additive so registering one does not hide

Delete from clusters that Headlamp may remove.

Co-authored-by: René Dudfield <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
---
 .../App/Home/ClusterContextMenu.tsx           | 27 +++++++++----------
